for %1$s (%2$s). The installed pack was left in place.'=>'Ikuna lati gba paká ede silẹ fun %1$s (%2$s). Paká ti a fi sori ẹrọ ni a fi silẹ ni ipo rẹ.','Language pack could not be unpacked.'=>'Paká ede ko le ni ipamọ.','Language pack is missing a catalog file. The installed pack was left in place.'=>'Paká ede ko ni faili katalogi. Paká ti a fi sori ẹrọ ni a fi silẹ ni ipo rẹ.','Language pack JSON catalog is invalid. The installed pack was left in place.'=>'Katalogi JSON paká ede ko tọ. Paká ti a fi sori ẹrọ ni a fi silẹ ni ipo rẹ.','Language pack could not be stored. The installed pack was left in place.'=>'Paká ede ko le ni ipamọ. Paká ti a fi sori ẹrọ ni a fi silẹ ni ipo rẹ.','Language pack PHP catalog could not be built. The installed pack was left in place.'=>'Katalogi PHP paká ede ko le kọ. Paká ti a fi sori ẹrọ ni a fi silẹ ni ipo rẹ.','Warning: The license for %1$s has expired. %2$s'=>'Ikilọ: Iwe-aṣẹ fun %1$s ti pari. %2$s','Manage licenses'=>'Ṣakoso awọn iwe-aṣẹ','Warning: %1$d plugin(s) have expired licenses: %2$s. %3$s'=>'Ikilọ: %1$d afikun(n) ni awọn iwe-aṣẹ ti pari: %2$s. %3$s','The license server accepted your key, but this site could not save its active license. Please contact support and mention this message.'=>'Olupin iwe-aṣẹ gba bọtini rẹ, ṣugbọn aaye yii ko le fipamọ iwe-aṣẹ ti o ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin ati pe eyi ni ifiranṣẹ.','PublishPress actions for %s. These tools apply only to this site. If several sites are connected and the requested site is unclear, ask which site to use before calling a tool. Confirm the target site before changing site data.'=>'Iṣe PublishPress fun %s. Awọn irinṣẹ wọnyi kan si aaye yii nikan. Ti ọpọlọpọ awọn aaye ba ti so pọ ati pe aaye ti a beere ko ye, beere iru aaye lati lo ṣaaju ki o to pe irinṣẹ kan. Jẹrisi aaye ti o nlo ṣaaju ki o to yipada data aaye.','WordPress version'=>'Version WordPress','MCP Adapter version'=>'Version MCP Adapter','Not active'=>'Ko ṣiṣẹ','HTTPS'=>'HTTPS','Available'=>'Wa','Required'=>'Ti beere','Application passwords'=>'Awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo','Unavailable; check WordPress or security plugin settings'=>'Ko si; ṣayẹwo awọn eto WordPress tabi awọn afikun aabo','Registered actions'=>'Awọn iṣe ti a forukọsilẹ','Selected actions exposed'=>'Àwọn iṣe ti a yan ti han','Changes saved.'=>'Àwọn ayipada ti fipamọ.','Changes saved. Restart your AI app or refresh its PublishPress connection to update the available actions.'=>'Àwọn ayipada ti fipamọ. Tun bẹrẹ ohun elo AI rẹ tabi tun mu asopọ PublishPress rẹ lati ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn iṣe ti o wa.','Changes saved. Connect your AI app to continue.'=>'Àwọn ayipada ti fipamọ. So ohun elo AI rẹ pọ lati tẹsiwaju.','Changes saved. Select at least one available action to continue.'=>'Àwọn ayipada ti fipamọ. Yan o kere ju iṣe kan ti o wa lati tẹsiwaju.','Update WordPress to continue'=>'Imudojuiwọn WordPress lati tẹsiwaju','WordPress 6.9 or newer is required.'=>'WordPress 6.9 tabi tuntun jẹ dandan.','Open WordPress updates'=>'Ṣii awọn imudojuiwọn WordPress','Install the MCP Adapter plugin'=>'Fi sori ẹrọ afikun MCP Adapter','Install the official WordPress MCP Adapter plugin to connect your AI service.'=>'Fi sori ẹrọ afikun MCP Adapter osise fun WordPress lati so iṣẹ AI rẹ pọ.','Manage plugins'=>'Ṣakoso awọn afikun','Set up MCP Adapter'=>'Ṣeto MCP Adapter','Use HTTPS to connect your AI'=>'Lo HTTPS lati so AI rẹ pọ','Both WordPress and site addresses must use HTTPS.'=>'Mejeeji WordPress ati awọn adirẹsi aaye gbọdọ lo HTTPS.','Open site settings'=>'Ṣii awọn eto aaye','Add a PublishPress plugin with AI actions'=>'Fi afikun PublishPress kun pẹlu awọn iṣe AI','You don\'t have any PublishPress plugins installed that support AI actions yet.'=>'O ko ni eyikeyi awọn afikun PublishPress ti a fi sori ẹrọ ti o ṣe atilẹyin awọn iṣe AI sibẹsibẹ.','Open PublishPress plugins'=>'Ṣii awọn afikun PublishPress','Allow application passwords for your account'=>'Gba awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo fun iroyin rẹ','Create an application password in your WordPress profile for assisted or manual setup.'=>'Ṣẹda ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo kan ninu profaili WordPress rẹ fun iṣeto iranlọwọ tabi ọwọ.','Application passwords are unavailable for your account. HTTPS or security plugin settings may need attention.'=>'Awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo ko wa fun iroyin rẹ. HTTPS tabi awọn eto afikun aabo le nilo akiyesi.','Open application passwords'=>'Ṣii awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo','PASTE_YOUR_APPLICATION_PASSWORD_HERE'=>'PASTE_YOUR_APPLICATION_PASSWORD_HERE','Ask my AI to help'=>'Beere lọwọ AI mi lati ṣe iranlọwọ','Recommended. Ask your AI for a setup script to run on your computer.'=>'Ti a ṣe iṣeduro. Beere lọwọ AI rẹ fun iwe afọwọkọ iṣeto lati ṣiṣẹ lori kọmputa rẹ.','Connect my AI app to PublishPress. Create a setup script and give me the exact terminal command to run it.

1. Ask me to select my AI app and OS (Windows, macOS or Linux). Use interactive choices if available, otherwise numbered options.
2. Create the script using your file tools. Request the specific permission if needed. If you cannot write locally, attach a downloadable script. Only fall back to code with save instructions when neither is possible. Use PowerShell on Windows and an appropriate script on macOS or Linux. Do not stop at explaining access limitations or provide only JSON.
3. Configure this local stdio server:
Name: %3$s
Display name: %4$s
Command: npx
Arguments: -y @automattic/mcp-wordpress-remote@latest
Environment: OAUTH_ENABLED=false, WP_API_URL=%1$s, WP_API_USERNAME=%2$s
Read WP_API_PASSWORD through a hidden terminal prompt.
Hub write access: %5$s. Only individually selected actions are exposed.
4. Check Node.js and npx. If missing, link to the official installer and tell me to reopen the terminal. Back up existing settings. Use a JSON/TOML parser or supported client command to merge only this server, preserving other settings and sites. Stop on invalid configuration or a conflicting endpoint. If replacing an old PublishPress desktop extension for this site, guide me to disable only that extension to avoid duplicate connections. Quote paths and values safely.
5. Give brief run, restart and approval instructions. Verify through the connection or give me a prompt to test in the app: confirm the site URL, list actual tools and perform a read-only lookup. Report whether write tools are available. If expected write tools are missing, ask me to check Allow actions that change site data and the selected actions in Hub, then refresh the connection. Do not claim success from saved configuration alone. Do not test writes during setup. Clarify the target site when ambiguous and ask for review before changing site data.'=>'So ohun elo AI mi pọ si PublishPress. Ṣẹda iwe afọwọkọ iṣeto kan ki o si fun mi ni aṣẹ terminal gangan lati ṣiṣẹ rẹ.

1. Beere lọwọ mi lati yan ohun elo AI mi ati OS (Windows, macOS tabi Linux). Lo awọn aṣayan ibanisọrọ ti o ba wa, bibẹkọ ti awọn aṣayan ti a kà.
2. Ṣẹda iwe afọwọkọ naa nipa lilo awọn irinṣẹ faili rẹ. Beere fun igbanilaaye pato ti o ba nilo. Ti o ko ba le kọ ni agbegbe, so iwe afọwọkọ ti o le ṣe igbasilẹ pọ. Kan pada si koodu pẹlu awọn ilana fipamọ nigbati ko si ọkan ti ṣeeṣe. Lo PowerShell lori Windows ati iwe afọwọkọ to yẹ lori macOS tabi Linux. Ma ṣe da duro ni sisọ awọn ihamọ iraye tabi pese JSON nikan.
3. Ṣeto olupin stdio agbegbe yii:
Orukọ: %3$s
Orukọ ifihan: %4$s
Aṣẹ: npx
Awọn ariyanjiyan: -y @automattic/mcp-wordpress-remote@latest
Ayika: OAUTH_ENABLED=false, WP_API_URL=%1$s, WP_API_USERNAME=%2$s
Ka WP_API_PASSWORD nipasẹ iwifunni terminal ti a pamọ.
Igbasilẹ rọọrun Hub: %5$s. Awọn iṣe ti a yan ni ẹyọkan nikan ni a fi han.
4. Ṣayẹwo Node.js ati npx. Ti o ba padanu, so si fifi sori ẹrọ osise ki o sọ fun mi lati tun ṣii terminal. Pa awọn eto to wa tẹlẹ. Lo itupalẹ JSON/TOML tabi aṣẹ alabara ti a ṣe atilẹyin lati darapọ mọ olupin yii nikan, preserving awọn eto ati awọn aaye miiran. Duro lori iṣeto ti ko wulo tabi aaye ipari ti o ni ija. Ti o ba n rọpo itẹsiwaju PublishPress atijọ fun aaye yii, dari mi lati mu itẹsiwaju yẹn nikan ṣiṣẹ lati yago fun awọn asopọ meji. Tẹ awọn ọna ati awọn iye ni aabo.
5. Fun awọn itọnisọna ṣiṣe, tun bẹrẹ ati ifọwọsi. Ṣayẹwo nipasẹ asopọ tabi fun mi ni iwifunni lati ṣe idanwo ni ohun elo: jẹrisi URL aaye, atokọ awọn irinṣẹ gangan ati ṣe iwadi kika nikan. Jabo boya awọn irinṣẹ kikọ wa. Ti a ti nireti awọn irinṣẹ kikọ ba padanu, beere lọwọ mi lati ṣayẹwo Gba awọn iṣe ti o yipada data aaye ati awọn iṣe ti a yan ni Hub, lẹhinna tun mu asopọ naa. Ma ṣe sọ pe aṣeyọri lati fipamọ iṣeto nikan. Ma ṣe idanwo awọn kikọ nigba iṣeto. Ṣalaye aaye ti a fojusi nigbati o ba jẹ ambiguous ki o beere fun atunyẹwo ṣaaju yipada data aaye.','enabled'=>'ti muu ṣiṣẹ','disabled'=>'ti a ko mu ṣiṣẹ','Set up manually'=>'Ṣeto ni ọwọ','Copy the configuration into your MCP client.'=>'Daakọ iṣeto naa sinu alabara MCP rẹ.','Actions available through PublishPress Hub.'=>'Àwọn iṣe ti o wa nipasẹ PublishPress Hub.','List WordPress users'=>'Atokọ awọn olumulo WordPress','Find users by name or role. The optional primitive capability filter checks effective access within each candidate page. Visit all total_pages even when a filtered page is empty. No email addresses or secrets are returned.'=>'Wa awọn olumulo nipasẹ orukọ tabi ipa. Ifilọlẹ agbara ipilẹ ti o wa ni aṣayan n ṣayẹwo iraye ti o munadoko laarin oju-iwe kọọkan. Ṣabẹwo si gbogbo total_pages paapaa nigbati oju-iwe ti a filtara ba ṣofo. Kò si awọn adirẹsi imeeli tabi awọn aṣiri ti a pada.','Get WordPress user capabilities'=>'Gba awọn agbara olumulo WordPress','Resolve exactly one user_id or username and return their identity, roles and effective primitive capabilities. Never guess a user ID. Object-specific permissions require a separate check for that object.'=>'Yan ọkan gangan user_id tabi orukọ olumulo ki o si pada idanimọ wọn, awọn ipa ati awọn agbara ipilẹ ti o munadoko. Ma ṣe gbooro user ID. Awọn igbanilaaye pato ohun kan nilo ayẹwo lọtọ fun ohun naa.','Find WordPress content'=>'Wa akoonu WordPress','Search readable posts, pages or a REST-enabled custom post type. Returns actual IDs, titles and permalinks. Use post_type=page for pages. Resolve ambiguous titles before using a URL. Default status is publish. Private and draft requests enforce WordPress permissions.'=>'Wa awọn ifiweranṣẹ, awọn oju-iwe tabi iru ifiweranṣẹ aṣa ti o ni REST ti o le ka. Pada awọn ID gangan, awọn akọle ati awọn permalinks. Lo post_type=page fun awọn oju-iwe. Yan awọn akọle ti o ni idiwọ ṣaaju lilo URL. Ipo aiyipada ni atẹjade. Awọn ibeere ikọkọ ati iyaworan mu awọn igbanilaaye WordPress ṣiṣẹ.','List WordPress post types'=>'Atokọ awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ WordPress','List readable REST-enabled post types and the capability names used for each type. Use these names for content lookups and permission questions.'=>'Atokọ awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o le ka ti o ni REST ati awọn orukọ agbara ti a lo fun iru kọọkan. Lo awọn orukọ wọnyi fun iwadi akoonu ati awọn ibeere igbanilaaye.','WordPress'=>'WordPress','Create WordPress user'=>'Ṣẹda olumulo WordPress','Create a new user account with a known username, email and one editable role. Ask for missing details. WordPress validates role assignment permissions. MCP rejects administrator and any role granting administrator-level capabilities. A password is generated privately. By default WordPress emails the user a password setup link. Never guess an email or request a password in chat.'=>'Ṣẹda iroyin olumulo tuntun pẹlu orukọ olumulo ti a mọ, imeeli ati ipa kan ti a le satunkọ. Beere fun awọn alaye ti o padanu. WordPress n ṣayẹwo awọn aṣẹ fun ipin ipa. MCP kọ awọn alakoso ati eyikeyi ipa ti o fun awọn agbara ipele alakoso. A ṣe ọrọigbaniwọle naa ni ikọkọ. Ni aiyipada, WordPress n firanṣẹ imeeli si olumulo pẹlu ọna asopọ eto ọrọigbaniwọle. Maṣe gboju imeeli tabi beere ọrọigbaniwọle ni ibaraẹnisọrọ.','Create WordPress content'=>'Ṣẹda akoonu WordPress','Create a post, page or REST-enabled custom post type. Use post_type=page for pages. Defaults to draft. Publish or schedule only when requested. WordPress checks creation, publishing and author-assignment permissions. Returns the actual ID and permalink.'=>'Ṣẹda ifiweranṣẹ, oju-iwe tabi iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe adani ti o ni REST. Lo post_type=page fun awọn oju-iwe. Aiyipada si draft. Ṣe atẹjade tabi ṣeto ni kete ti a ba beere. WordPress n ṣayẹwo awọn aṣẹ fun ṣẹda, atẹjade ati ipin onkọwe. N tọka ID gangan ati permalink.','Update WordPress content'=>'Ṣatunkọ akoonu WordPress','Edit an existing post, page or REST-enabled custom post by its verified ID. Find content first if the ID is unknown. Only supplied fields change. WordPress checks object, publishing and author-assignment permissions. No deletion, arbitrary metadata or options are supported.'=>'Ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ to wa tẹlẹ, oju-iwe tabi ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe adani ti o ni REST nipasẹ ID ti a fọwọsi. Wa akoonu akọkọ ti ID ko ba mọ. Awọn aaye ti a pese nikan ni wọn yipada. WordPress n ṣayẹwo awọn aṣẹ fun nkan, atẹjade ati ipin onkọwe. Ko si piparẹ, metadata ti a yan tabi awọn aṣayan ni a gba laaye.','Use the exact input types shown in discovery.'=>'Lo awọn iru titẹ ti o han ni awari.','You cannot list users.'=>'O ko le ṣe atokọ awọn olumulo.','Provide either a user ID or an exact username.'=>'Pese boya ID olumulo tabi orukọ olumulo gangan.','No matching user belongs to this site.'=>'Ko si olumulo ti o baamu ti o ni aaye yii.','You cannot inspect this user.'=>'O ko le ṣe ayẹwo olumulo yii.','Choose a REST-enabled post type.'=>'Yan iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni REST.','This post type does not support content lookup.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni atilẹyin fun wiwa akoonu.','MCP tools cannot create users with administrator-level access. Use the WordPress Users screen for this change.'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ MCP ko le ṣẹda awọn olumulo pẹlu wiwọle ipele alakoso. Lo iboju Awọn olumulo WordPress fun iyipada yii.','Provide at least one content field to update.'=>'Pese o kere ju aaye akoonu kan lati ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Choose an existing REST-enabled post type.'=>'Yan iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni REST ti o wa tẹlẹ.','This post type does not support content writes.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni atilẹyin fun awọn kikọ akoonu.','You cannot perform this operation.'=>'O ko le ṣe iṣẹ yii.','Object must be loaded before initializing.'=>'Nkan gbọdọ wa ni ikojọpọ ṣaaju ki o to bẹrẹ.','This license key is managed in wp-config.php and cannot be edited from the Hub.'=>'Ikọwe iwe-aṣẹ yii ni a n ṣakoso ni wp-config.php ati pe a ko le satunkọ lati Hub.','No license key found'=>'Ko si ikọwe iwe-aṣẹ ti a ri','This license key is managed in wp-config.php and cannot be deactivated from the Hub.'=>'Ikọwe iwe-aṣẹ yii ni a n ṣakoso ni wp-config.php ati pe a ko le mu un kuro lati Hub.','Invalid conflict resolution request.'=>'Ibéèrè ipinnu ariyanjiyan ti ko wulo.','The selected plugin is not available for activation.'=>'Plugin ti a yan ko si wa fun ìmúdájú.','Cleanup was stopped because the selected plugin is not active or the other version is still loaded. Neither copy was deleted.'=>'Iṣẹ mimọ ti da duro nitori plugin ti a yan ko ni iṣe tabi ẹya miiran ti wa ni ikojọpọ. Ko si ẹda ti a pa.','The selected plugin is active, but the other version could not be removed. Please remove it from the Plugins screen.'=>'Plugin ti a yan n ṣiṣẹ, ṣugbọn a ko le yọ ẹya miiran kuro. Jọwọ yọ kuro lati iboju Awọn Plugin.','The selected plugin is no longer active. Please reactivate it from the Plugins screen.'=>'Plugin ti a yan ko si ni iṣe mọ. Jọwọ mu un ṣiṣẹ lẹẹkansi lati iboju Awọn Plugin.','No existing license key was found for this plugin.'=>'Ko si ikọwe iwe-aṣẹ ti o wa tẹlẹ fun plugin yii.','Database Tables'=>'Awọn tabili Database','PublishPress Plugins'=>'Awọn Plugin PublishPress','PublishPress Hub Debug Log'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ Debug PublishPress Hub','Debug Log'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ Debug','The debug log is empty.'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ debug jẹ ofo.','Version'=>'Version','Debug Mode'=>'Ipo Debug','Enabled'=>'Ti mu ṣiṣẹ','Disabled'=>'Ti pa','Generated At'=>'Ti ṣe ni','Plugins'=>'Awọn Plugin','No PublishPress plugins found.'=>'Ko si awọn plugin PublishPress ti a ri.','Tables'=>'Tabili','No database table information was available.'=>'Ko si alaye tabili data ti o wa.','Size'=>'Iwọn','Engine'=>'Ẹrọ','Rows'=>'Awọn ila','Collation'=>'Iṣakojọpọ','Charset'=>'Charset','Total Database Size'=>'Iwọn Gbogbogbo Database','Not installed'=>'Ko fi sori ẹrọ','Active'=>'I ṣiṣẹ','Inactive'=>'Ko ṣiṣẹ','unknown'=>'aimọ','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Free plugin not set for plugin family: %s'=>'Plugin ọfẹ ko ti ṣeto fun ẹbi plugin: %s','Pro plugin not set for plugin family: %s'=>'Plugin pro ko ti ṣeto fun ẹbi plugin: %s','License activation error. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Aṣiṣe iṣiṣẹ iwe-aṣẹ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','License deactivation error. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Aṣiṣe itusilẹ iwe-aṣẹ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license is currently disabled. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ti wa ni idiwọ ni akoko yii. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license has expired. Please contact support to renew it.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ti parẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin lati tun un ṣe.','This license key could not be activated. It may be invalid, blocked, or not authorized for this plugin. Please verify the key and contact PublishPress support if the problem continues.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko le ṣee ṣe. O le jẹ aiṣedeede, ti dènà, tabi ko ni aṣẹ fun plugin yii. Jọwọ jẹrisi bọtini naa ki o kan si atilẹyin PublishPress ti iṣoro naa ba tẹsiwaju.','This license cannot be used for this plugin. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko le ṣee lo fun plugin yii. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license does not match the plugin you are trying to activate. Please contact support for assistance.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko ba plugin ti o n gbiyanju lati ṣiṣẹ pọ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','License key does not match our records. Please contact support for assistance.'=>'Bọtini iwe-aṣẹ ko ba awọn igbasilẹ wa. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','No license key provided. Please enter a valid license key.'=>'Ko si bọtini iwe-aṣẹ ti a pese. Jọwọ tẹ bọtini iwe-aṣẹ to wulo.','Your site URL is required to activate the license. Please enter a valid site URL to continue.'=>'URL aaye rẹ jẹ dandan lati mu iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ tẹ URL aaye to wulo lati tẹsiwaju.','License activation limit reached. Please contact support to upgrade or deactivate on another site.'=>'Iwọn iṣiṣẹ iwe-aṣẹ ti de. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin lati ṣe igbesoke tabi mu ṣiṣẹ ni aaye miiran.','This license cannot be activated. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko le ṣee mu ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','License server error. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Aṣiṣe olupin iwe-aṣẹ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','The license server returned an invalid response. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Olupin iwe-aṣẹ ti da pada pẹlu idahun aiṣedeede. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license is inactive for this site. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko ṣiṣẹ fun aaye yii. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','Plugin activation failed. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Iṣiṣepọ plugin kuna. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This action is not possible because the plugin is already installed.'=>'Iṣe yii ko ṣee ṣe nitori plugin ti ti fi sori ẹrọ tẹlẹ.','Plugin deactivation failed. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Iṣeduro plugin kuna. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','Plugin family not found. Please contact support for help.'=>'Ẹbi plugin ko ri. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This action is not possible because both free and pro versions are installed. Please uninstall one version to continue.'=>'Iṣe yii ko ṣee ṣe nitori mejeji awọn ẹya ọfẹ ati pro ti fi sori ẹrọ. Jọwọ yọ ọkan ninu awọn ẹya kuro lati tẹsiwaju.','Plugin installation failed. Please contact support for help.'=>'Fifi sori plugin kuna. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This action is not possible because the plugin is not activated. Please activate the plugin and try again.'=>'Iṣe yii ko ṣee ṣe nitori plugin ko ti mu ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ mu plugin ṣiṣẹ ki o gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Plugin not found in our available plugins list. Please contact support for help.'=>'Plugin ko ri ninu atokọ awọn plugins ti a le lo wa. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This action is not possible because the plugin is not installed. Please install the plugin and try again.'=>'Iṣe yii ko ṣee ṣe nitori plugin ko ti fi sori ẹrọ. Jọwọ fi plugin sori ẹrọ ki o gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Unknown license server error. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Aṣiṣe olupin iwe-aṣẹ aimọ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','Sell digital products, programs, and services from your website.'=>'Ta awọn ọja oni-nọmba, awọn eto, ati awọn iṣẹ lati oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ.','Create and manage tags, categories, and taxonomy terms.'=>'Ṣẹda ati ṣakoso awọn tag, ẹka, ati awọn ọrọ taxonomy.','Organize taxonomy terms into groups and display them in clouds, tabs, and lists.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ọrọ taxonomy sinu awọn ẹgbẹ ki o si ṣafihan wọn ni awọn awọsanma, awọn taabu, ati awọn atokọ.','Define tasks that authors must complete before publishing.'=>'Ṣalaye awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ti awọn onkọwe gbọdọ pari ṣaaju ki wọn to gbejade.','Control who can edit and view your content.'=>'Ṣakoso ẹni ti o le ṣe atunṣe ati wo akoonu rẹ.','Create, manage and display authors for your content.'=>'Ṣẹda, ṣakoso ati ṣafihan awọn onkọwe fun akoonu rẹ.','All the tools you need to improve the block editor.'=>'Gbogbo awọn irinṣẹ ti o nilo lati mu olutẹwe bulọọgi dara si.','Control your admin area and user roles.'=>'Ṣakoso agbegbe abojuto rẹ ati awọn ipa olumulo.','Schedule changes to your posts.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ayipada si awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ.','Organize, schedule, and plan your publishing.'=>'Ṣeto, ṣeto, ati gbero atẹjade rẹ.','Approve and schedule new versions to your published posts.'=>'Fọwọsi ati ṣeto awọn ẹya tuntun si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ti gbejade.','Organize your posts into issues or series.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ sinu awọn iṣoro tabi awọn jara.','Create custom URLs for your posts and external links.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn URL aṣa fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ ati awọn ọna asopọ ita.','Create custom statuses and publishing workflows.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ipo aṣa ati awọn ilana atẹjade.','Dependency "%s" not found in container.'=>'Ibeere "%s" ko ri ni akojọpọ.','Error validating license: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe ni ṣiṣayẹwo iwe-aṣẹ: %s','Error getting license info: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe ni gbigba alaye iwe-aṣẹ: %s','The license server denied this request. This can happen when a license key or site has been blocked. Please contact PublishPress support for help.'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe iwe-aṣẹ kọja ibeere yii. Eyi le ṣẹlẹ nigbati a ti dina bọtini iwe-aṣẹ tabi aaye kan. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin PublishPress fun iranlọwọ.','Too many requests. Please try again later.'=>'Ibeere pupọ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii.','An error occurred while processing your request.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan waye nigba ti a n ṣiṣẹ ibeere rẹ.','Template not found: %s'=>'Awoṣe ko ri: %s','Path cannot be empty'=>'Ọna ko le jẹ ofo','File extension cannot be empty'=>'Itọsọna faili ko le jẹ ofo','Invalid file path: null byte detected'=>'Ọna faili ti ko tọ: null byte ti a ṣe awari','Invalid file path: directory traversal detected'=>'Ọna faili ti ko tọ: itọsọna irinna ti a ṣe awari','Invalid file path: parent directory does not exist: %s'=>'Ọna faili ti ko tọ: itọsọna obi ko si: %s','Invalid file path: unable to resolve path'=>'Ọna faili ti ko tọ: ko le yanju ọna','Invalid file path: operation not allowed outside permitted directories'=>'Ọna faili ti ko tọ: iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ko gba laaye ni ita awọn itọsọna ti a fọwọsi','Download URL failed WordPress validation'=>'URL gbigba silẹ kọja idanwo WordPress','Downloaded plugin file does not exist'=>'Faili plugin ti a gba silẹ ko si','Downloaded plugin file is empty'=>'Faili plugin ti a gba silẹ jẹ ofo','Cannot read downloaded plugin file'=>'Ko le ka faili plugin ti a gba silẹ','Downloaded file is not a valid ZIP archive. The download URL may be returning an error page.'=>'Faili ti a gba silẹ kii ṣe iwe-itaja ZIP ti o tọ. URL gbigba silẹ le n pada oju-iwe aṣiṣe kan.','Failed to unzip plugin file: %s'=>'Kò le ṣii faili plugin: %s','Failed to unzip plugin file'=>'Kò le ṣii faili plugin','Failed to activate plugin: %s'=>'Kò le fa plugin: %s','Resolve conflicts for network-active plugins from Network Admin.'=>'Yanju awọn ija fun awọn plugins ti n ṣiṣẹ nẹtiwọọki lati ọdọ Alakoso Nẹtiwọọki.','Activation recovery failed. Both plugin copies were retained. Please restore the previous version from the Plugins screen.'=>'Igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn kuna. Mejeeji awọn ẹda plugin ni a pa. Jọwọ mu ẹya ti tẹlẹ pada lati iboju Plugins.','The other plugin could not be deactivated.'=>'Plugin miiran ko le wa ni mu kuro.','The selected plugin did not remain active.'=>'Plugin ti a yan ko ni duro ni iṣẹ.','The selected plugin could not be activated. Neither copy was deleted and the previous activation settings were restored.'=>'Ko le mu ẹrọ amugbooro ti a yan ṣiṣẹ. Kò si ẹda ti a pa ati pe a ti pada si awọn eto mu ṣiṣẹ ti tẹlẹ.','Failed to delete plugin: %s'=>'Kò le pa ẹrọ amugbooro: %s','No update available for this plugin'=>'Ko si imudojuiwọn ti o wa fun ẹrọ amugbooro yii','Invalid update information for this plugin'=>'Alaye imudojuiwọn ti ko tọ fun ẹrọ amugbooro yii','Update package not available'=>'Kò si àpótí imudojuiwọn ti o wa','Failed to update plugin: %s'=>'Kò le ṣe imudojuiwọn ẹrọ amugbooro: %s','Plugin update failed'=>'Imudojuiwọn ẹrọ amugbooro kuna','Invalid download URL provided'=>'URL gbigba ti ko tọ ni a pese','Download URL must use HTTP or HTTPS protocol'=>'URL gbigba gbọdọ lo ilana HTTP tabi HTTPS','Download URL is not from an allowed domain: %s'=>'URL gbigba ko wa lati agbegbe ti a gba laaye: %s','Could not create a temporary package file'=>'Kò le ṣẹda faili àpótí igba diẹ','Failed to download plugin: %s'=>'Kò le gba ẹrọ amugbooro: %s','The plugin package download failed'=>'Gbigba àpótí ẹrọ amugbooro kuna','Failed to get plugin information: %s'=>'Kò le gba alaye ẹrọ amugbooro: %s','MCP Adapter could not be installed or activated. Use the plugin page or contact your host.'=>'MCP Adapter kò le fi sori ẹrọ tabi mu ṣiṣẹ. Lo oju-iwe ẹrọ amugbooro tabi kan si olugbaisese rẹ.','MCP Adapter activated.'=>'MCP Adapter ti mu ṣiṣẹ.','N/A'=>'N/A','Changelogs'=>'Changelogs','Changelog'=>'Changelog','Loading plugins...'=>'Loading plugins...','Diagnostics'=>'Diagnostics','ERR'=>'ERR','.'=>'.']];